	u) keep internal records of infringements of this Regulation and of measures taken in accordance with Article 58(2); and 
	v) fulfil any other tasks related to the protection of personal data. 
2) The Commissioner shall facilitate the submission of complaints referred to in point (f) of paragraph 1 by measures such as a complaint submission form which can also be completed electronically, without excluding other means of communication. 
